sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / operator
    participant UI as Browser
    participant Chat as Local FastAPI
    participant Model as Foundry chat model
    participant Logs as App Insights / Log Analytics
    participant CLI as Local evaluation CLI
    participant Evals as Foundry Evals + judge

    User->>UI: Open chat
    UI->>Chat: Create conversation
    Chat-->>UI: Conversation ID
    loop Each chat turn
        User->>UI: Question + Enter / Send
        UI->>Chat: Question + conversation ID
        Chat->>Chat: Validate limits, read history
        Chat->>Model: Instructions + history + question
        Model-->>Chat: Original answer + metadata
        Chat->>Chat: Validate answer, build turn with IDs
        Chat->>Logs: OpenTelemetry turn record + flush
        Note over Chat,Logs: Technical traces are also collected.<br/>Flush does NOT confirm searchable ingestion.
        Chat->>Chat: Update server-owned history
        Chat-->>UI: Answer + turn ID + trace ID
        UI-->>User: Display answer
    end

    Note over Logs,CLI: Later, after ingestion delay.<br/>The chat server may be stopped.
    User->>CLI: Run evaluation command
    CLI->>CLI: Freeze UTC window
    CLI->>Logs: Query original turns in window
    Logs-->>CLI: Payloads + hashes + IDs
    CLI->>CLI: Preserve, validate, deduplicate, snapshot
    alt Successful query has no turns
        CLI-->>User: no_data report, null rates, exit 0
    else Turns available
        CLI->>CLI: Validate English dataset and size
        CLI->>Evals: Versioned criteria + original dataset
        Evals-->>CLI: Eval ID + run ID
        CLI->>CLI: Persist IDs in manifest
        Note over Evals: Judge ORIGINAL answers:<br/>scope, fluency, coherence,<br/>unnecessary refusal.
        loop Until completed or timeout
            CLI->>Evals: Read status
            Evals-->>CLI: Status
        end
        CLI->>Evals: Fetch all output pages
        Evals-->>CLI: Per-turn scores and reasons
        CLI->>CLI: Verify originals, save results and reports
        CLI-->>User: Report path, exit 0 for quality findings
    end
    Note over CLI,Evals: Technical errors preserve available evidence and exit nonzero.<br/>Timed-out remote runs may continue.
